+- A string rejection inside the turn calls `onError` with an `Error` carrying that string as its message, then runs `afterSession`, and the rejection still propagates to the caller ([validated by: calls onError with an Error carrying the thrown string and runs afterSession while rethrowing](../../src/orchestration/onErrorNonError.acceptance.test.ts#L53)).
